    "text": "At Christmas, Emma’s sister Isabella comes to Hartfield with her husband, John Knightley, and their five {CHILDREN}. Emma and Mr. Knightley make {PEACE} over the baby: they will never agree about Harriet, but they {AGREE} about nephews. Mr. Knightley is a {DOTING} uncle, {FLYING} little Henry’s {KITE}, and Mr. Woodhouse frets over everyone’s {HEALTH}.",
